<title>GREECE: Table of Greek mutual fund flows, assets.</title>
<headline>Table of Greek mutual fund flows, assets.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices.</p>
<p>					Dec 19/Dec 18    Dec 19/Dec 31,95</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.12		12.33</p>
<p>  Fixed income mutual funds	   0.05		13.40</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.31		 8.53</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			    1.28		-2.11</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.81		39.97</p>
<p>  Fixed income mutual funds	   0.86		45.87</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.12	     -24.72</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.10		-8.22</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.89		55.62</p>
<p>  Fixed income mutual funds	   0.89		63.12</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.18	     -19.78</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    1.37	     -10.96</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31, 1991.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
